Model weights

The engine downloads these models from Hugging Face on first use. They are
not included here.

  Qwen/Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-1.7B-VoiceDesign          Apache License 2.0
  Qwen/Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-1.7B-Base                 Apache License 2.0
  mlx-community/Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-1.7B-VoiceDesign-4bit
